&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a key role in shaping architecture, improving system performance and reliability, and delivering features that directly impact customers. While you’ll help resolve production issues, your focus will be on building durable, scalable solutions that prevent them. &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Although this is a 100% remote role, candidates must be located in or around&amp;nbsp;Cheltenham, United Kingdom.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
